      {
        "id": 114175,
        "name": "SeraAlexandria",
        "username": "SeraAlexandria",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-18T15:46:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I also found a typo some time ago; I had to dig a bit to find it but here it is.</p><p>On the civilian card from the expansion, the first ongoing ability says, \"At the end of the round, each civilian moves up to its move value towards the closest scenario marker, the hero players deciding ties.\"</p><p>It actually took me a couple reads to figure out that it was supposed to say, \"the hero players decide in ties.\"&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:00.659Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 10927,
        "topic_slug": "tactics-typos",
